onnx.inferonnxruntime.quantr

vocab_size1024r
normalize_typeper_featurer
subsampling_factor8r)

model_typeEncDecHybridRNNTCTCBPEModelr
version1r
model_authorNeMorh
urlahttps://catalog.ngc.nvidia.com/orgs/nvidia/teams/nemo/models/stt_es_fastconformer_hybrid_large_pcr*
commentOnly the CTC branch is exportedrÁ
docﬂThis collection contains the Spanish FastConformer Hybrid (CTC and Transducer) Large model (around 114M parameters) with Punctuation and Capitalization. It is trained on the NeMo PnC ES ASRSET (Fisher, MCV12, MLS, Voxpopuli) containing 1424 hours of Spanish speech. It utilizes a Google SentencePiece [1] tokenizer with vocabulary size 1024, and transcribes text in upper and lower case Spanish alphabet along with spaces, period, comma, question mark and inverted question mark.